{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["de5ae612-b7c9-46aa-ab33-38804d5aff42"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["a6c52c0e-ca43-562c-9183-f1b6136bfe7b"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["bdc14cf4-43e3-55e0-b98e-987a7605d016"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"Reasoner results transaction recomputed inferred definitions for 575 components, with no authored edits. Sampled concepts span fluoride products and substances (e.g., sodium monofluorophosphate toothpastes, fluoride ion), enzyme and isoenzyme substances (Hydrolase, Clinically relevant isoenzyme), and Aluminum compound. The tools confirmed current parents for these samples but not the before-and-after hierarchy change for each concept, so the specific classification effects still need review."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["698ef74d-6992-4e0c-ae70-f2d3b1226bf3"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["c5760ff4-6873-5116-aac0-2e45c5f194c9"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["f9bb9bba-b172-5c9a-8ecb-d837a89e6613"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"Reasoner run: the classifier committed 575 inferred-definition updates. They are a mix of substances and clinical drug products.\n\nTwo examples:\n- **Fluoride ion:** It is now defined as Fluoride (substance) [372639009] with a \"Has disposition\" restriction to Oxidant [1382093006].\n- **Sodium monofluorophosphate toothpastes:** Products such as the 0.004 MG/MG and 0.0086 MG/MG toothpastes are inferred under three parents. These are Product containing fluorine and fluorine compound [768689003], Product manufactured as dental dosage form [767317003] and Product containing sodium and sodium compound [767404002]."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["3e6cfeb1-5ec0-4189-b341-009fe640fe64"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["076dde98-7688-5393-9fe2-15304606af58"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["661ca392-457a-5626-bcb0-a7b4a250a5ad"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A curator on the Device Extension Module committed a change to component 076dde98-7688-5393-9fe2-15304606af58. It was ACTIVE before the commit and is still ACTIVE. I couldn't tell what the edit was. The component doesn't resolve as a concept or a semantic under the current view, so I have no name, identifier, or field values to compare. The change may be in a version this view can't see."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["bc60b794-cfcf-4c82-bce0-bc642eed8c03"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["076dde98-7688-5393-9fe2-15304606af58"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["9fc0f474-d024-5fc9-9c1c-22eddf2f4226"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"Added an FDA Premarket Submission Number identifier (K231481) to the device concept GeneXpert® XPRS4PLEX-10, also known as \"Xpert Xpress CoV-2/Flu/RSV plus\". The concept sits under Multi-Target Respiratory Specimen Nucleic Acid Test Including Sars-Cov-2 And Other Microbial Agents."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["c2f2e768-7ae3-47d8-a23c-c98a4d5585a8"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["633dbf7b-b638-56ba-a4df-629fb4df69d9"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["74ead3dd-c34f-530e-ac63-58e602547c76"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"Added the device concept **GeneXpert® XPRS4PLEX-10** (UUID 1bdab7cf-00d4-5ff8-9108-66644b524b59). \"Xpert Xpress CoV-2/Flu/RSV plus\" is its regular-name synonym. It sits under *Multi-Target Respiratory Specimen Nucleic Acid Test Including Sars-Cov-2 And Other Microbial Agents*. It was created with a GS1 identifier (07332940008604), a Public Device Record Key, FDA Premarket Submission Number K231481, and a GMDN term (*Multiple-type respiratory pathogen nucleic acid IVD, kit, nucleic acid technique (NAT)*)."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["53fdad38-dfea-41aa-b584-c688d78383ec"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["52241723-7c68-5372-8d12-81ec7abf4561"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["7cb5997e-733b-5f54-a586-121d5d6fecea"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A new Device Company Pattern entry (2d2b714e-3ce5-4f40-bc4a-1e6bf095593d) is now active on **GeneXpert® XPRS4PLEX-10**. It sets the Device Labeler to **CEPHEID**. The concept sits under *Multi-Target Respiratory Specimen Nucleic Acid Test Including Sars-Cov-2 And Other Microbial Agents*. The Device Extension Author made the change in the Device Extension Module."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["a876465e-41eb-49fa-b623-13e593f43a69"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["e6dab11c-676b-524e-8694-a22a72e5a304"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["9c656817-f7a7-5f05-8b81-72aea653982b"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A Predicate Device Pattern entry was added to **GeneXpert® XPRS4PLEX-10**. It names **BioFire® Respiratory Panel 2.1 423742** as the predicate device. The GeneXpert concept is a child of *Multi-Target Respiratory Specimen Nucleic Acid Test Including Sars-Cov-2 And Other Microbial Agents*. It also carries FDA Premarket Submission Number K231481 and CEPHEID as device labeler.\n\nThe identifier you gave is the Predicate Device pattern's UUID, not a separate semantic instance. I read the change from that pattern's entry on the GeneXpert concept, so that attachment is my inference."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["20c468dd-3b58-45c0-ad25-c26468fcba29"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["c5cf1757-c963-5232-b1d1-3e2ff113ef5b"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["942e8419-9f63-513b-9f4c-221a2549b34a"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A new Indication for Use entry is now active on **GeneXpert® XPRS4PLEX-10**. That concept sits under *Multi-Target Respiratory Specimen Nucleic Acid Test Including Sars-Cov-2 And Other Microbial Agents*. The text describes the Xpert Xpress CoV-2/Flu/RSV plus test, an automated multiplex RT-PCR assay. It detects and differentiates SARS-CoV-2, influenza A, influenza B and/or RSV viral RNA in nasopharyngeal and anterior nasal swabs from people with signs and symptoms of respiratory tract infection."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["a4358af8-9472-4bd5-a20f-1fcc9e432129"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["ebe976a8-ac8c-56f9-9d18-d7942bcac5d5"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["b4243d14-4783-5abc-9f32-f3362dcd4f9a"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A new concept, **GeneXpert® XPRS4PLEX-10**, is now active in the Device Extension Module, authored by Device Extension Author. It is defined only as a subtype of **Multi-Target Respiratory Specimen Nucleic Acid Test Including Sars-Cov-2 And Other Microbial Agents**. It has no other attributes or attached semantics."}]}]}}
